   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&9^3=729=31(23)+16\\\\[5pt]&9^{205}=9\\,(9^3)^{68}=9\\,(31\\cdot23+16)^{68}\\\\[5pt]&(31\\cdot23+16)^{68}=31A+16^{68}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Every term except $16^{68}$ contains the}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{factor 31.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
