   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&16^{68}=2^{272}=2^2\\,(2^5)^{54}\\\\[5pt]&{}=4\\,(32)^{54}=4\\,(31+1)^{54}\\\\[5pt]&{}=4\\,(31B+1)=31(4B)+4\\end{aligned}\\]",
